The record you must store, and for how long.

  CREATE TABLE idempotency (
      key           text PRIMARY KEY,
      request_hash  bytea NOT NULL,   -- reject reuse w/ other body
      response      jsonb,
      state         text NOT NULL,    -- in_progress | complete
      created_at    timestamptz NOT NULL
  );

  BEGIN;
    INSERT INTO idempotency VALUES ($1,$2,NULL,'in_progress',now());
    ... perform the effect ...       -- unique violation = a retry
    UPDATE idempotency SET state='complete', response=$3 WHERE key=$1;
  COMMIT;

Retention MUST exceed the client's max retry horizon.
